<title>UK: GECC sets 2.0 billion Slovak crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 2.0 billion Slovak crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Slovak crown issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN SLK   COUPON     11.625    MATURITY    29.OCT.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 20	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
